('privacy.thirdParties.item2', 'it', 'Airbnb - per i reindirizzamenti delle prenotazioni (piattaforma esterna)'),
('privacy.thirdParties.item2', 'de', 'Airbnb - für Buchungsweiterleitungen (externe Plattform)'),
('privacy.thirdParties.item3', 'en', 'YouTube (Google) - for displaying video content. Embedded videos may set third-party cookies in accordance with YouTube''s privacy policy.'),
('privacy.thirdParties.item3', 'hr', 'YouTube (Google) – za prikaz video sadržaja. Ugrađeni videozapisi mogu postavljati kolačiće trećih strana u skladu s pravilima privatnosti YouTubea.'),
